_URL)\n\nfeature_collections = eodc_ogcapi.feature_collections()\nconsole.print(feature_collections)","position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":67,"column":1}},"key":"AGQ2HC18HP"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":68,"column":1},"end":{"line":68,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Here, the URL of the WFS is read in first and a features object of the WFS is created with the help of the owslib.ogcapi.features library. From this, the various layers are loaded into the feature_collection and output.","position":{"start":{"line":68,"column":1},"end":{"line":68,"column":1}},"key":"RrpODHTt1l"}],"key":"MYDmfGg6Bs"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":70,"column":1},"end":{"line":70,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Output: ","position":{"start":{"line":70,"column":1},"end":{"line":70,"column":1}},"key":"of9sBwyQDu"},{"type":"emphasis","position":{"start":{"line":70,"column":1},"end":{"line":70,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"‘adriatic_vessels’, ‘Vlbg_EGMS_L3_E’, ‘Vlbg_EGMS_L3_U’, ‘STATISTIK_AUSTRIA_DSR’","position":{"start":{"line":70,"column":1},"end":{"line":70,"column":1}},"key":"KNeYZwamWL"}],"key":"ftOE2eHHN6"}],"key":"Vk0wPMdOI3"},{"type":"break","key":"v1EfpPCihd"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"**Filter data according to desired extent**","key":"IRSKOTOYL9"}],"key":"IFV7wKCJEl"},{"type":"break","key":"eXpns9hHqC"},{"type":"code","lang":"","value":"bbox = [9.7549833,47.4537861,9.7616428,47.4581097]\n\nfield_items = eodc_ogcapi.collection_items(\n    \"Vlbg_EGMS_L3_U\",\n    bbox = bbox,\n    limit = 2000,\n)\n\ndf = gpd.GeoDataFrame.from_features(field_items[\"features\"], crs=\"EPSG:4326\")","position":{"start":{"line":75,"column":1},"end":{"line":85,"column":1}},"key":"wHPip4iuMX"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":87,"column":1},"end":{"line":87,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"A bounding box, a rectangle with a specified spatial extent, is created and all objects from the feature Vlbg_EGMS_L3_U (ground movement high/low) that lie within the bounding box are selected. A geodata frame is then generated from these objects.","position":{"start":{"line":87,"column":1},"end":{"line":87,"column":1}},"key":"IReEWnGnfH"}],"key":"BYGg6yXt3S"},{"type":"break","key":"g3GBc3bPR3"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"**sort the data**","key":"tfu0l9nZIE"}],"key":"Golqp93kam"},{"type":"break","key":"kDhpi60RH7"},{"type":"code","lang":"","value":"df_sorted = df[sorted(df.columns)]\ndf_sorted.head()","position":{"start":{"line":92,"column":1},"end":{"line":95,"column":1}},"key":"KsIfXfnQxQ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":96,"column":1},"end":{"line":96,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The dataframe is sorted according to the columns (alphabetically) and the first five rows are printed.","position":{"start":{"line":96,"column":1},"end":{"line":96,"column":1}},"key":"rLwRwBD96Z"}],"key":"O3cIqL5u8T"},{"type":"break","key":"Kh3ElCW3Li"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"**Displaying the data on a map**","key":"ozUB6JelA1"}],"key":"zOXCbSBBAG"},{"type":"break","key":"wD1yUW1iko"},{"type":"code","lang":"","value":"ax = df[[\"geometry\"]].plot(\n    facecolor=\"red\", figsize=(12, 6)\n)\ncx.add_basemap(ax, crs=df.crs.to_string(), source=cx.providers.OpenStreetMap.Mapnik);","position":{"start":{"line":101,"column":1},"end":{"line":106,"column":1}},"key":"YLKCFTjbMX"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":108,"column":1},"end":{"line":108,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The objects loaded in the geodata frame are displayed here in a map. OpenStreetMap was selected as the background map.","position":{"start":{"line":108,"column":1},"end":{"line":108,"column":1}},"key":"jG6KiCsKYy"}],"key":"h0YWqf60ud"},{"type":"break","key":"UmkXKGMIuQ"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"**Adaptation of the dataframe to NumPy**","key":"apVRxJQMAo"}],"key":"ez2Nll5jzT"},{"type":"break","key":"EKQDFD9POf"},{"type":"code","lang":"","value":"df_np = df_sorted.to_numpy()\ncolumns_names=list(df_sorted)\nacquisition_dates = columns_names[0:363]\n\nacquisition_date_str = [f\"{d[:4]}-{d[4:6]}-{d[6:8]}\" for d in acquisition_dates]\nacquisition_date_num = [datetime.strptime(d, \"%Y-%m-%d\") for d in acquisition_date_str]","position":{"start":{"line":113,"column":1},"end":{"line":120,"column":1}},"key":"b4xy0HUMQ9"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":122,"column":1},"end":{"line":122,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"A NumPy array is created from the dataframe with to_numpy. The names of the first 364 columns, which are the dates of the respective recording, are saved in acquisition_dates. The column names are then converted into a date format.","position":{"start":{"line":122,"column":1},"end":{"line":122,"column":1}},"key":"oQ5F08fOWf"}],"key":"zzVqiaskkm"},{"type":"break","key":"ceRIkQ8I5V"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"**Creating the diagram**","key":"jiFonpvFcb"}],"key":"DrfEca7h0V"},{"type":"break","key":"aeBqUTocTf"},{"type":"code","lang":"","value":"fig_EGMS_timeseries, axes = plt.subplots(nrows=1, ncols=1,facecolor='white', figsize=[10, 5])\n\nfor i in range(len(df_np)):\n    axes.plot(acquisition_date_num,df_np[i,0:363], \".-\", markerfacecolor=\"w\")\n\naxes.xaxis.set_major_locator(mdates.MonthLocator(interval=6))\naxes.xaxis.set_major_formatter(mdates.DateFormatter(\"%b %Y\"))\nplt.setp(axes.get_xticklabels(), rotation=30, ha=\"right\")\naxes.set_xlabel('Date')\naxes.set_ylabel('EGMS up/down [cm]')\naxes.grid(visible=True,axis='y')","position":{"start":{"line":127,"column":1},"end":{"line":139,"column":1}},"key":"Hb7umtNI96"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":141,"column":1},"end":{"line":141,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"This creates a diagram that shows the up/down movement of the individual objects/points over time. Each point is displayed in a different color and the format of the date on the x-axis is adjusted again.","position":{"start":{"line":141,"column":1},"end":{"line":141,"column":1}},"key":"SSPiH6PuCt"}],"key":"Tc9ptmIcIM"}],"key":"A4Wb1Re2dh"}],"key":"OzjRzgtbSO"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}}}